},"Member:40855042":{"__typename":"Member","id":"40855042","name":"Yvonne Li","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:322506640"}},"Member:11885543":{"__typename":"Member","id":"11885543","name":"Adam J. Baron","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:304395885"}},"Event:317519271":{"__typename":"Event","id":"317519271","title":"Agentic AI Year in Review","dateTime":"2026-12-08T17:00:00-08:00","description":"**Agentic AI Year in Review!**\nJoin us for an exciting evening discussing the top startup trends in Agentic AI of 2026 and predictions for 2027.\n\n**Featuring:**\n\n* [Shruti Merchant](https://www.linkedin.com/in/shrutimerchant/), Partner, Pear VC\n* [Tabish Gilani](https://www.linkedin.com/in/tabishgilani/), Product Growth Partner, a16z Speedrun\n* [Tracy Rubin](https://www.linkedin.com/in/tracy-rubin-a54439156/), Partner, Cooley LLP\n\n**Registration**\nTo attend, you need to [register at luma](https://luma.com/veyokv1b?utm_source=bachat) **\u003c-** **Please register at Luma as the venue requires this.**\n\n**Agenda**\nDate: Tues December 8th, 5:00pm (**doors open at 5pm**)\nLocation: GitHub, 275 Brannan St, San Francisco (entrance on Brannan)\n\n* 5:00-6:00pm doors open for networking\n* 6:00-7:00pm panel discussion\n* 7:00-7:30pm additional networking\n\n**Want to demo?**\nIf you are interested in demoing at a future event, please fill out the [application form](https://forms.gle/ahzwgnAAs51pdiTQ9).","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/bay-area-bot-chat-and-conversational-app-developers/events/317519271/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:537224566"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:537224566"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:19723324"},"socialProofInsights":{"__typename":"SocialProofInsights","isTrendingEvent":false,"totalInterestedUsers":24,"interestedUsersSample":[{"__typename":"Member","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:322506640"}},{"__typename":"Me